  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "这台服务器没人在操作，内存却每天都在悄悄变少",
      "audio": "s01.mp3",
      "start_sec": 0.0,
      "end_sec": 4.44,
      "start_frame": 0,
      "end_frame": 133
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "表面上还能跑，直到某天深夜，它突然卡死，服务全挂",
      "audio": "s02.mp3",
      "start_sec": 4.52,
      "end_sec": 9.32,
      "start_frame": 136,
      "end_frame": 280
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "很多人的第一反应是重启，重启能撑几天，然后又慢了回去",
      "audio": "s03.mp3",
      "start_sec": 9.4,
      "end_sec": 13.72,
      "start_frame": 282,
      "end_frame": 412
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "其实这不是玄学，是典型的内存泄漏",
      "audio": "s04.mp3",
      "start_sec": 13.8,
      "end_sec": 16.944,
      "start_frame": 414,
      "end_frame": 508
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "程序申请了一块堆内存，用完却忘了还",
      "audio": "s05.mp3",
      "start_sec": 17.024,
      "end_sec": 20.504,
      "start_frame": 511,
      "end_frame": 615
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "一两个忘还不致命，可怕的是它每分钟都在申请，越积越多",
      "audio": "s06.mp3",
      "start_sec": 20.584,
      "end_sec": 25.504,
      "start_frame": 618,
      "end_frame": 765
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "第一步，用free命令看总量，已用一路涨，可用一路掉",
      "audio": "s07.mp3",
      "start_sec": 25.584,
      "end_sec": 30.12,
      "start_frame": 768,
      "end_frame": 904
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "第二步，用top按内存排序，真凶就排在第一行",
      "audio": "s08.mp3",
      "start_sec": 30.2,
      "end_sec": 34.472,
      "start_frame": 906,
      "end_frame": 1034
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "确认它该不该吃这么多，再决定杀掉它，还是修代码",
      "audio": "s09.mp3",
      "start_sec": 34.552,
      "end_sec": 38.872,
      "start_frame": 1037,
      "end_frame": 1166
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
